{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》重頭戲「極速狂奔」向動作特技人員致敬，29歲新一代打女劉穎鏇（Tiffany）聯同張振朗及周嘉洛與朱敏瀚挑戰連串超高難度特技，將現場氣氛推至頂峰。這段長達數分鐘演出得到網民高度讚賞！凌空鉸剪腳！ 動作自然流暢且極具力量感。（...</p>\n<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》重頭戲「極速狂奔」向動作特技人員致敬，29歲新一代打女劉穎鏇（Tiffany）聯同張振朗及周嘉洛與朱敏瀚挑戰連串超高難度特技，將現場氣氛推至頂峰。這段長達數分鐘演出得到網民高度讚賞！</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499277238276_547753826aff20e1a0893.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_2026-11-20 00.06.32.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499277238276_547753826aff20e1a0893.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>凌空鉸剪腳！ 動作自然流暢且極具力量感。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>29歲劉穎鏇親身上陣演繹凌空鉸剪腳絕技</h2>\n<p>29歲小花劉穎鏇在《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》中化身最強打女，親身上陣挑戰極高要求武打動作，與「錢家班」的武師對打，毫不怯場地使出凌空鉸剪腳等高難度招式，動作自然流暢且極具力量感。為了完美應付這類激烈動作場面，她早前曾接受嚴格特訓將體脂率維持在10%極限狀態，成功展現監製文偉鴻從《超能使者》及《隱形戰隊》開始為她塑造的性感打女形象。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951049948007130_14327896056aff20e32945d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_2026-11-19 23.44.30.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951049948007130_14327896056aff20e32945d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>極速狂奔 Speed &amp; Stunt由四位新晉小生花旦演出，（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499666238855_7020316416aff20e56fb3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"2b2ce4e8-ecdd-4c0b-94ad-94431a4a4a7c.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499666238855_7020316416aff20e56fb3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>好好身手！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>張振朗領軍飛車致敬幕後特技團隊付出</h2>\n<p>這場名為極速狂奔驚險場面並非單純為了刺激觀眾眼球，四人熱血沸騰演出「亦是向一眾辛苦付出的幕後動作演員及特技人致敬」。視帝張振朗在環節中展示型爆飛車特技，加上各種危險動作背後，全賴動作組不辭勞苦默默準備，這次演出旨在肯定特技團隊多年來為影視作品付出的無數汗水。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499976965300_19801533986aff20e827351.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"fb2ff2ec-afcf-4712-9951-319ec02204bd.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510499976965300_19801533986aff20e827351.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500257662483_20050477896aff20eb19577.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"9a0ebf55-90a8-4698-b30e-93b3e5127ab8.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500257662483_20050477896aff20eb19577.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>表演環節有一半預早錄影，其後打到入直播一號廠！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民激讚最強打女展現無可挑剔完美身段</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看完這段精彩演出後，紛紛在網上留言將焦點集中在劉穎鏇身上。有網民直接留言指「最搶眼係動作女神最強Body“劉穎鏇”呀！」，對其專業武打水準給予高度評價。另有觀眾留言大讚「Tiffany 靚， 身材超fit，超有型，打得好型」，網絡平台上充斥大量針對她個人武打動作與身段的正面回饋。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951050058623803_361600706aff20ee56f82.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b135d48b-4488-4385-8cf7-73f868bbaf14.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951050058623803_361600706aff20ee56f82.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500746927579_16176366236aff20f010b43.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"502345a2-5a4b-4eee-ac6f-fca95dce5548.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500746927579_16176366236aff20f010b43.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Tiffany的演出獲錢嘉樂讚賞！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>觀眾點評四大演員驚險演出為全晚最佳</h2>\n<p>除了針對個人表現外，整體四人演出同樣獲得網民壓倒性好評，被大量留言公認為當晚最精彩環節。不少網民熱烈留言表示「全晚最精彩，最好看！！！」及「台慶咁多環節!呢part係最驚喜最精彩!」，表達對極速狂奔特技的熱愛。更有觀眾點出四人合作火花，留下「4個極有喜感，幾搞笑，動作又好」以及「Good Team」等字眼。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500970697312_9832554776aff20f21397e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510500970697312_9832554776aff20f21397e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.189386+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1335,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:16:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:57:55.844975+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:34:04.184682+00:00","content_hash":"dd259f16fc49c7a6a5e89a4171410b1dbf8c35619dbadabe5c54f01b6faf06cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}